import LOEIS.A345.A345012.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A345012

Lexicographically earliest sequence of nonnegative terms forming a clockwise square spiral when nothing else is read except the nonprime/prime nature of the digits (see the Comments section).

The 75 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A345012

/-- Known terms of `A345012`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
